# Project-specific prod-infra substrings that must NEVER be a baseline DB URL.
# Copy to prod_url_patterns.private (gitignored) and fill with YOUR real infra
# hostnames / subnets. One lower-cased substring per line; blank / `#` lines ignored.
# The generic patterns (prod, .cluster.local, .rds.amazonaws.com, ...) stay in the
# script; these project-specific ones are loaded from the private file at runtime.
# db.your-domain.example
# .your-domain.example
# 10.0.0.
# your-build-host
